      "author": "Leon Made This / s010s",
      "changes": "Original airy A-style conifer, preserved r20 GLB under independently reviewed doc1 identity; normalized SHORT normals require KHR_mesh_quantization / Three.js 0.180.0. Performance acceptance only for recorded M5 Pro/Metal profile; SwiftShader frame-budget failure and subpixel aliasing retained. 原创轻透A型针叶树；仅文档doc1身份，模型字节不变，保留设备与细针采样限制。",
      "original_author": "Leon Made This / s010s",
      "original_glb_sha256": "f7331e9602faea1e2d29bc9b185baa2fbd3ee16bd36bb2d6641eabc4aa019fea",
